# 🦊 BimboWallet-ClientOfficial open-source frontend and client-side specifications for the **Bimbo Chain Network** — a next-generation, sovereign, and completely **Non-EVM Layer 1 Blockchain** built from scratch for ultimate performance, speed, and privacy.---## ⚡ Ecosystem ArchitectureUnlike legacy networks that rely on bloated virtual machines, **Bimbo Chain** operates on a fully optimized, custom architecture designed to run seamlessly on a global scale, maintaining incredible efficiency even on lightweight mobile devices.### Key Technological Features:* **Sovereign Non-EVM Core:** Built entirely from the ground up in Python. It does not run Ethereum bytecode, making it natively immune to automated Web3 exploits, smart contract drainers, and legacy EVM bot scans.* **Dynamic Block Times:** The Bimbo Algorithm automatically adjusts block consensus speed in real-time between **1 and 7 seconds maximum**, ensuring blazing-fast transaction finality based on network demand.* **Automatic Data Pruning:** Features a high-performance background memory engine that compacts ledger structures on the fly (reducing raw states from 22.3 MB down to 5.6 MB), maintaining a minimal hardware footprint.* **Stratum TCP Mining Protocol:** Supports direct, raw TCP mining infrastructure over port `50002` alongside an isolated HTTP/RPC layer on port `15497` for absolute network parallelism.---## 🔒 Absolute Privacy & SovereigntyBimbo Chain enforces a strict privacy-first, anti-surveillance protocol. The architecture completely rejects legacy Web2 data-collection mechanisms:* **NO KYC** processes.* **NO Email addresses** or phone numbers required.* **NO Centralized passwords** stored on any database.### What exists on the ledger?The network only processes and maintains two pieces of cryptographic data:1. A uniquely derived public address using the sovereign **`bm2c`** base58 prefix.2. The current balance of native **\$BMC** coins associated with that specific address.---## 🔑 Non-Custodial Security ModelThis repository contains the client-side implementation of **BimboWallet**. Security and cryptography are fully decoupled from the closed-source core layer to guarantee trust:* **Local Key Generation:** Private keys are generated 100% locally inside your client/APK sandbox using secure Elliptic Curve Cryptography (**secp256k1**).* **On-Device Signing:** Transactions are signed mathematically on your local device before being broadcasted via HTTP POST to the decentralized RPC nodes (`bimborpc.com`). * **Sovereign Control:** The network infrastructure never sees, stores, or transmits your private key. *⚠️ **CRITICAL WARNING:** Your private key is your sole responsibility. If lost, it cannot be recovered by anyone, including the Bimbo Chain core developers. Keep it safe.*---## 🌐 Official Network Links* **Official Wallet UI & APK Mirror:** [bimbochain.com](https://bimbochain.com)* **Real-time Ledger Explorer (BimboScan):** [bimboscan.com](https://bimboscan.com)* **Decentralized RPC Endpoint:** `https://bimborpc.com`---*Developed under the Bimbo Sovereign Protocol. Built for absolute privacy, financial independence, and high-performance decentralized execution.*